# S619 Learning route family wiring — GREEN evidence

date: 2026-11-03

## Wired controls (features/learning/routes.ts)
- Operator-token password input on every Learning route (overview, configuration, packs, decisions, evidence x2, history): input value from model.learningOperatorToken, OnInput -> LearningOperatorTokenChanged; the handler persists to role-model.learning.operator-token and readbacks resolve the bearer at request time (readback tokenProvider).
- LearningPacks actions: Roll back active pack (scope-wide) -> POST /api/role-model/operator/learning/rollback-pack body {scopeId, reason:"operator_ui_rollback"}; Engage kill switch -> POST /api/role-model/operator/learning/kill-switch body {scopeId}; Release kill switch -> same route body {scopeId, engaged:false}. Commands carry the readback scope and token.
- LearningDecisions selects (Role, Task, Outcome, Advisory state, Observation origin): OnChange -> LearningDecisionFilterChanged, persisted in model.learningDecisionFilters.
- Action status rendered via data-learning-action-status; token/action/filter state lives in model.ts and commands/update/app plumbing.

