## Lead view wiring still required (view.ts is lead-owned)
Pass model state to the learning routes:
- Learning: learningOverviewRoute(..., h, model.learningOperatorToken)
- LearningConfiguration: learningConfigurationPage(..., h, model.learningOperatorToken, model.learningPackAction)
- LearningPacks: learningPacksPage(..., h, model.learningOperatorToken, model.learningPackAction)
- LearningDecisions: learningDecisionsPage(..., h, model.learningOperatorToken, model.learningDecisionFilters)
- LearningEvidence: learningEvidencePage(..., h, model.learningOperatorToken, model.learningPackAction)
- LearningHistory: learningHistoryPage(..., h, model.learningOperatorToken, model.learningPackAction)
Without these args the controls dispatch correctly but render initial values/status from defaults.
